INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`Emote1`,`Emote2`,`Emote3`,`Emote4`,`EmoteDelay1`,`EmoteDelay2`,`EmoteDelay3`,`EmoteDelay4`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`) SELECT '95786','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Brother Nimetz sent you all the way from Stranglethorn? You have made quite the trek then. It must be a matter of some importance.$B$BCome, tell me what has brought you all the way to Southshore.','70532' FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `quest_offer_reward` WHERE `ID`<=>'95786');
INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`Emote1`,`Emote2`,`Emote3`,`Emote4`,`EmoteDelay1`,`EmoteDelay2`,`EmoteDelay3`,`EmoteDelay4`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`) SELECT '95799','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','Ah, Loremaster Dibbs never fails to bring me things of great interest. While my area of study isn\'t focused on trolls, I certainly can appreciate his passion.$B$BThis is splendid news. I will get a team together to strike out for this lost city of I\'lalai at once!','70532' FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `quest_offer_reward` WHERE `ID`<=>'95799');
INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`Emote1`,`Emote2`,`Emote3`,`Emote4`,`EmoteDelay1`,`EmoteDelay2`,`EmoteDelay3`,`EmoteDelay4`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`) SELECT '96078','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','<Master Gadrin listens closely as you explain your journey and how you came to possess the I\'lalai tablet etchings.>$B$BIt was good of Kin\'Weelay to send you here. I am grateful he has taken such a strong interest in preserving and discovering parts of our ancestral heritage we have lost over the centuries. We Darkspear didn\'t break from the Gurubashi that long ago, in the grand scheme of things, you know.$B$BAnyway, Kin\'weelay asked me to give this to you, as thanks for all your efforts this day.','70532' FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `quest_offer_reward` WHERE `ID`<=>'96078');
