I also have a scout\'s report that the local trolls seem to be agitated, mentioning the word..."I\'lalai".

I must know if this is related to Kurzen\'s corruption! Here, take the fetishes and legends along with this scouting report to Loremaster Dibbs. With any luck he will be able to unravel some of their secrets.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0','70532','0' FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `quest_template` WHERE `ID`<=>'95786');

Would you mind delivering the letter to Ironforge for me? I will write a copy of my translations of the tablets for you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0','70532','0' FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `quest_template` WHERE `ID`<=>'95799');

These etchings must be taken to our spiritual leader, Master Gadrin in Sen\'jin Village. He is one of the wisest Darkspear and he will wish to hear the truth of this tale.

I have prepared an extra copy of this tale for you as well. If you ever lose your copy, I would be happy to create another, for a small fee.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0','70532','0' FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM `quest_template` WHERE `ID`<=>'96078');

